      "blob_url": "https://github.com/pytorch/torchtitan/blob/95fa5c2abbe626fe4ddcfb0fb3d73d8f580133d5/torchtitan%2Fmodels%2Fgpt_oss%2FREADME.md",
      "changes": 23,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/torchtitan/contents/torchtitan%2Fmodels%2Fgpt_oss%2FREADME.md?ref=95fa5c2abbe626fe4ddcfb0fb3d73d8f580133d5",
      "deletions": 11,
      "filename": "torchtitan/models/gpt_oss/README.md",
      "patch": "@@ -9,16 +9,17 @@ The released 20B and 120B flavors conventionally use\n `assets/hf/gpt-oss-20b` and `assets/hf/gpt-oss-120b`. TorchTitan keeps those\n asset-path hints without shipping unverified full training recipes.\n \n-## Supported Features\n-- FSDP/HSDP, TP, EP, CP, PP\n-- Grouped matrix multiplication for efficient computation\n+## Supported Parallelisms\n \n-CI already runs CP and PP on the debug model:\n-- `gpt_oss_pp+fsdp+cp+ep+sacop` (`gpt_oss_debugmodel_flex_fsdp2_cp2_pp2_ep4_sac`)\n-- `gpt_oss_pp+fsdp+ep+sacop`\n+Coverage below matches the features listed for gpt-oss and the gpt-oss jobs in\n+`tests/integration_tests` (e.g. `gpt_oss_pp+fsdp+cp+ep+sacop`,\n+`gpt_oss_pp+fsdp+ep+sacop`).\n \n-Those jobs use Interleaved1F1B. FlexInnerAttention zero-bubble / split-backward PP\n-tests are disabled in `tests/integration_tests/features.py` because\n-FlexInnerAttention `BlockMask` is not a Tensor (`stage_backward_input` calls\n-`requires_grad` on every stage input). Full-backward schedules\n-(1F1B / GPipe / Interleaved1F1B) are unaffected.\n+| Feature | Notes |\n+|---------|-------|\n+| FSDP / HSDP | Default data-parallel path |\n+| Tensor Parallel (TP) | Supported |\n+| Expert Parallel (EP) | Composes with FSDP and PP in CI |\n+| Context Parallel (CP) | Composes with FSDP, EP, and PP in CI (`gpt_oss_debugmodel_flex_fsdp2_cp2_pp2_ep4_sac`) |\n+| Pipeline Parallel (PP) | Interleaved1F1B exercised in CI. FlexInnerAttention zero-bubble / split-backward PP tests are disabled in `tests/integration_tests/features.py` because FlexInnerAttention `BlockMask` is not a Tensor (`stage_backward_input` calls `requires_grad` on every stage input). Full-backward schedules (1F1B / GPipe / Interleaved1F1B) are unaffected. |\n+| Grouped matrix multiplication | For efficient MoE-style computation |",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/pytorch/torchtitan/raw/95fa5c2abbe626fe4ddcfb0fb3d73d8f580133d5/torchtitan%2Fmodels%2Fgpt_oss%2FREADME.md",
      "sha": "3603513b4a86a754bb12498562d5889a53255882",
      "status": "modified"
    }
